note Exercism-style exercise "rna-transcription": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/rna-transcription
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note torna writes the RNA complement of DNA strand dna into o (G to C, C to G, T to A, A to U)
note and returns its length.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/rna-transcription
om2
fn torna dna view uchar * o edit uchar * to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
